---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="About" description="Background and interests of Triston Wilson." currentPath="/about/">
  <section class="page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Profile <span class="slash">/</span> Background</p>
    <h1>About<span class="title-cursor" aria-hidden="true">_</span></h1>
    <p>A little more about what I study and what I enjoy working on.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="section-id">01</span><h2>Education</h2></div>
    <div class="section-body"><p>I'm a computer engineering student at the University of Utah. I like understanding how systems work across abstraction layers, from logic gates to operating systems.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="section-id">02</span><h2>Interests</h2></div>
    <div class="section-body"><p>Digital hardware, computer architecture, low-level software, graphics, Linux, and the engineering tools used to design and understand these systems.</p><div class="term-list"><span>hardware</span><span>systems</span><span>graphics</span><span>linux</span></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="section-id">03</span><h2>Beyond coursework</h2></div>
    <div class="section-body"><p>This page is a focused place for personal background and experience. It will grow independently from project documentation as the site content is finalized.</p></div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
